---
source: crates/apinata-core/tests/import_parity.rs
expression: snapshot
---
Converted Own Auth / request.auth.token [Own Auth.yml]: the value is kept as the secret variable `own_auth_token`, not in the file
Converted collection [opencollection.yml]: runs use the environment `Environment` by default, since it holds the imported credentials
Converted imported credentials [environments/Environment.yml]: the imported credentials are the secret variables `own_auth_token`; their values are kept in the secret store, not in the file
== Own Auth.yml
info:
  name: Own Auth
  type: http
  seq: 2

http:
  method: GET
  url: http://localhost:3000/health
  auth:
    type: bearer
    token: "{{own_auth_token}}"

settings:
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: inherit
  followRedirects: true
  maxRedirects: 5
  forwardAuthorizationHeader: false
== environments/Environment.yml
name: Environment
variables:
  - secret: true
    name: own_auth_token
== opencollection.yml
opencollection: 1.0.0

info:
  name: Bearer

request:
  auth:
    type: bearer
    token: "{{token}}"
bundled: false
extensions:
  bruno:
    ignore:
      - node_modules
      - .git
    presets:
      defaultEnvironment: Environment
